msgid "Møller Plesset perturbation theory"
msgstr "Møller-Plesset 微扰理论"

msgid ""
"Closed-shell Møller-Plesset perturbation theory up to full fourth order "
"[MP4(SDTQ)] is part of the coupled-cluster program."
msgstr "闭壳层 Møller-Plesset 微扰理论，最高可达完全四阶 [MP4(SDTQ)]，是耦合簇程序的一部分。"

msgid ""
"The commands ``MP2, MP3, MP4`` perform the MP calculations up to the "
"specified order (lower orders are included)."
msgstr "命令 ``MP2, MP3, MP4`` 执行 MP 计算直至指定阶数（包含较低阶数）。"

msgid ""
"Normally, no further input is needed if the ``MPn`` card directly follows "
"the corresponding HF-SCF. Otherwise, occupancies and orbitals can be "
"specified as in the CI program. The resulting energies are stored in "
"variables as explained in section `special variables "
"<variables.html#special-variables>`__."
msgstr ""
"通常，如果 ``MPn`` 卡片紧跟在相应的 HF-SCF 计算之后，则无需进一步输入。否则，可以像在 CI "
"程序中那样指定占据数和轨道。计算得到的能量存储在变量中，如 `special variables <variables.html#special-"
"variables>`__ 章节所述。"

msgid ""
"Dual basis set calculations are possible for the closed-shell methods, see "
"section `dual basis set calculations "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#dual-basis-set-calculations>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于闭壳层方法，可以进行双重基组计算，参见 `dual basis set calculations "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#dual-basis-set-calculations>`__ 章节。"

msgid "Expectation values for MP2"
msgstr "MP2 的期望值"

msgid ""
"One-electron properties can be computed if an ``EXPEC`` card follows the "
"``MP2`` card (the ``GEXPEC`` directive has no effect in this case). "
"Properties are obtained as analytical energy derivatives with or without "
"taking into account the orbital relaxation, which can be specified as"
msgstr ""
"若 ``MP2`` 卡片后跟随 ``EXPEC`` 卡片（此时 ``GEXPEC`` "
"指令无效），则可计算单电子性质。性质通过解析能量导数获得，可选择是否考虑轨道弛豫，具体可通过以下方式指定："

msgid ""
"Note that, in MP2, calculation of fully relaxed properties may be much more "
"expensive than computing only the energy or properties without the orbital "
"relaxation effect. The syntax for operators *opname* is explained in section"
" `One-electron operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__. See also ``DM`` in section `saving the density matrix "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#saving-the-density-matrix>`__, and "
"``NATORB`` in section `natural orbitals "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在 MP2 中，计算完全弛豫性质可能比仅计算能量或不考虑轨道弛豫效应的性质昂贵得多。算符 *opname* 的语法在章节 `单电子算符和期望值 "
"(GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-"
"values-gexpec>`__ 中解释。另请参见 `保存密度矩阵 "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#saving-the-density-matrix>`__ 章节中的 "
"``DM``\\ ，以及 `自然轨道 <moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-"
"orbitals>`__ 章节中的 ``NATORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Expectation values for MP3"
msgstr "MP3 的期望值"

msgid ""
"``EXPEC``\\ [,\\ *opname*] Fully relaxed one-electron properties are "
"available for MP3 (see section `First- and second-order properties for CCSD "
"from expectation-value CC theory (XCCSD) <excited_states_with_equation-of-"
"motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#first-and-second-order-properties-for-ccsd-from-"
"expectation-value-cc-theory-xccsd>`__, Paper 2). Currently, this is only "
"working without frozen core orbitals, i.e. ``CORE,0`` must be specified. MP2"
" properties are also computed and printed."
msgstr ""
"``EXPEC``\\ [,\\ *opname*] MP3 可计算完全弛豫的单电子性质（参见章节 `基于期望值 CC 理论的 CCSD 一阶和二阶性质"
" (XCCSD) <excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#first-"
"and-second-order-properties-for-ccsd-from-expectation-value-cc-theory-"
"xccsd>`__\\ ，论文 2）。目前，此功能仅在无冻结芯轨道时有效，即必须指定 ``CORE,0``\\ 。MP2 性质也会被计算并输出。"

msgid "Saving the density matrix"
msgstr "保存密度矩阵"

msgid ""
"The first-order density matrix in AO basis is stored in record *record* on "
"file *ifil*. Two types of density matrices are stored in the same record: "
"the one without orbital relaxation contribution is stored as *set 1*, "
"meanwhile with the orbital relaxation contribution, it is stored as *set 2*."
" If the ``NORELAX`` directive is given on the ``EXPEC`` card prior to the "
"``DM`` card, only the orbital unrelaxed density matrix is computed and "
"stored. See also ``NATORB`` in section `natural orbitals "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"原子轨道基组中的一阶密度矩阵存储在文件 *ifil* 的记录 *record* 中。两种类型的密度矩阵存储在同一记录中：不含轨道弛豫贡献的存储为 "
"*set 1*\\ ，而包含轨道弛豫贡献的存储为 *set 2*\\ 。如果在 ``DM`` 卡片之前的 ``EXPEC`` 卡片上给出了 "
"``NORELAX`` 指令，则仅计算并存储轨道非弛豫密度矩阵。另请参见 `自然轨道 "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-orbitals>`__ 章节中的 "
"``NATORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Natural orbitals"
msgstr "自然轨道"

msgid ""
"Calculate natural orbitals. The number of printed external orbitals in any "
"given symmetry is *nprint*) (default 2). *nprint=-1* suppressed the "
"printing. The natural orbitals and the density matrix are saved in a dump "
"record *record* on file *ifil*. If *record.ifil* is specified on a ``DM`` "
"card (see above), this record is used. If different records are specified on"
" the ``DM`` and ``NATORB`` cards, an error will result. The record can also "
"be given on the ``SAVE`` card. Natural orbitals are computed for both the "
"nonrelaxed and relaxed density matrices if available, which are stored in "
"the same record as *set 1* and *set 2*, respectively."
msgstr ""
"计算自然轨道。在任何给定对称性下打印的外部轨道数量为 *nprint*\\ （默认为2）。\\ *nprint=-1* "
"将抑制打印。自然轨道和密度矩阵保存在文件 *ifil* 的转储记录 *record* 中。如果在 ``DM`` 卡片（见上文）中指定了 "
"*record.ifil*\\ ，则使用该记录。如果在 ``DM`` 和 ``NATORB`` 卡片上指定了不同的记录，将导致错误。该记录也可以在 "
"``SAVE`` 卡片上给出。如果可用，将针对非弛豫和弛豫密度矩阵计算自然轨道，它们分别作为 *set 1* 和 *set 2* 存储在同一记录中。"

msgid ""
"Note that the effective (relaxed) density matrix of non-variational methods "
"like MP2, CCSD, or CCSD(T) does not strictly behave as a density matrix. For"
" instance, it has non-zero matrix elements between core and valence "
"orbitals, and therefore core orbitals are affected by the natural orbital "
"transformation. Also, occupation numbers can be greater than 2.0 or less "
"than 0.0. If ``CORE`` is given (*natcor=1*), the core orbitals are frozen by"
" excluding them from the natural orbital transformation."
msgstr ""
"请注意，非变分方法（如 MP2、CCSD 或 "
"CCSD(T)）的有效（弛豫）密度矩阵并不严格表现为密度矩阵。例如，它在芯层和价层轨道之间具有非零矩阵元，因此芯轨道会受到自然轨道变换的影响。此外，占据数可能大于"
" 2.0 或小于 0.0。如果给出 ``CORE``\\ （\\ *natcor=1*\\ ），则通过将芯轨道排除在自然轨道变换之外来冻结它们。"

msgid "Polarizabilities and second-order properties for MP2"
msgstr "MP2 的极化率和二阶性质"

msgid ""
"Analytical MP2 static dipole polarizabilities and other second order "
"properties can be computed using the ``POLARI``. By default the dipole "
"operator is used, but other one-electron operators can be specified on the "
"``POLARI`` directive. Currently, this is only working without frozen core "
"orbitals, i.e., C͡ORE,0 must be given. This option is only available without"
" using the density fitting approximation. The dipole polarizabilities are "
"stored in the variables ``POLXX, POLXY, POLXZ, POLYY, POLYZ, POLZZ``."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``POLARI`` 计算解析的 MP2 静态偶极极化率和其他二阶性质。默认使用偶极算符，但可以在 ``POLARI`` "
"指令上指定其他单电子算符。目前，这仅在不使用冻结芯轨道的情况下有效，即必须给出 C͡ORE,0。此选项仅在未使用密度拟合近似时可用。偶极极化率存储在变量"
" ``POLXX, POLXY, POLXZ, POLYY, POLYZ, POLZZ`` 中。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Computes the full tensors for the dipole and quadrupole operators."
msgstr "计算偶极和四极矩算符的完整张量。"

msgid ""
"Nonsymmetrized first-order perturbed density matrix resulting from CP "
"equations for MP2 can be stored for further use if ``RECMP2=``\\ "
"*record.ifil* is given."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了 ``RECMP2=``\\ *record.ifil*\\ ，则可将 MP2 的 CP 方程产生的非对称一阶微扰密度矩阵存储以供后续使用。"

msgid "CPHF for gradients, expectation values and polarizabilities"
msgstr "用于梯度、期望值和极化率的 CPHF"

msgid ""
"The accuracy and other parameters of the CPHF calculations necessary to "
"compute gradients and response properties can be modified using the ``CPHF``"
" directive:"
msgstr "计算梯度和响应性质所需的 CPHF 计算的精度和其他参数可以使用 ``CPHF`` 指令进行修改："

msgid ""
"``THRMIN`` CPHF convergence threshold (default 1.d-6). ``THRESH`` and "
"``ACCU`` are aliases for this."
msgstr "``THRMIN`` CPHF 收敛阈值（默认 1.d-6）。\\ ``THRESH`` 和 ``ACCU`` 是其别名。"

msgid "``MAXIT`` Maximum number of iterations (default 50)."
msgstr "``MAXIT`` 最大迭代次数（默认 50）。"

msgid "``SHIFT`` Level shift for CPHF (default 0.1)."
msgstr "``SHIFT`` CPHF 的能级位移（默认 0.1）。"

msgid "``DIIS`` First macroiteration in which DIIS is used (default 1)"
msgstr "``DIIS`` 首次使用DIIS的宏迭代（默认值 1）"

msgid ""
"``DISM`` First microiteration in which DIIS is used (default 1; in "
"microiterations the core contribution is frozen)."
msgstr "``DISM`` 首次使用DIIS的微迭代（默认值 1；在微迭代中，核心贡献被冻结）。"

msgid ""
"``SAVE`` Record on which the CPHF solution can be saved for later restarts. "
"The solution is saved automatically in geometry optimizations and frequency "
"calculations."
msgstr "``SAVE`` 用于保存CPHF解以供后续重启的记录。在几何优化和频率计算中，解会自动保存。"

msgid ""
"``START`` Record from which initial guess is read. A starting guess is read "
"automatically in geometry optimizations and frequency calculations."
msgstr "``START`` 从中读取初始猜测的记录。在几何优化和频率计算中，会自动读取起始猜测。"

msgid ""
"In density-fitting MP2, only ``THRMIN`` is active, the rest of the options "
"are handled automatically."
msgstr "在密度拟合MP2中，仅 ``THRMIN`` 有效，其余选项会自动处理。"

msgid "Density-fitting MP2 (DF-MP2, RI-MP2)"
msgstr "密度拟合MP2 (DF-MP2, RI-MP2)"

msgid ""
"invokes the density fitted MP2 program. The present implementation works "
"only without symmetry. ``RI-MP2`` is an alias for the command ``DF-MP2``."
msgstr "调用密度拟合MP2程序。当前实现仅能在无对称性下工作。\\ ``RI-MP2`` 是命令 ``DF-MP2`` 的别名。"

msgid "The following options can be specified:"
msgstr "可指定以下选项："

msgid "Spin-component scaled MP2 (SCS-MP2)"
msgstr "自旋分量标度 MP2 (SCS-MP2)"

msgid ""
"The spin-component scaled MP2 energy as proposed by Grimme (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1569242>`__ **118**, 9095 (2003)) is printed "
"automatically using the default scaling factors (1.2 for antiparallel spin, "
"1/3 for parallel spin). These factors can be modified using the options "
"``SCSFACS`` and ``SCSFACT``, respectively, i.e."
msgstr ""
"由 Grimme 提出的自旋分量标度 MP2 能量 (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1569242>`__ **118**, 9095 (2003)) "
"会使用默认标度因子（反平行自旋为 1.2，平行自旋为 1/3）自动打印。这些因子可以分别通过选项 ``SCSFACS`` 和 ``SCSFACT`` "
"进行修改，即"

msgid ""
"The SCS-MP2 total energy is stored in the variable ``EMP2_SCS``. Gradients "
"and first-order properties can be computed for SCS-MP2 by setting the option"
" ``SCSGRD=1``. This only operational for density fitted MP2 and local MP2 "
"methods, i.e. using"
msgstr ""
"SCS-MP2 总能量存储在变量 ``EMP2_SCS`` 中。通过设置选项 ``SCSGRD=1`` 可以计算 SCS-MP2 "
"的梯度和一阶性质。这仅适用于密度拟合 MP2 和局域 MP2 方法，即使用"

msgid "Perturbation-adapted Perturbation Theory (PAPT)"
msgstr "微扰适应微扰理论 (PAPT)"

msgid ""
"The perturbation-adapted zero-order hamiltonian described in J. Chem. Phys. "
"156, 011101 (2022); https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0079853 is available for "
"closed-shell systems by putting"
msgstr ""
"J. Chem. Phys. 156, 011101 (2022); https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0079853 "
"中描述的微扰适应零阶哈密顿量可用于闭壳层体系，方法是在输入中于 ``MP2``\\ 、\\ ``MP3``\\ 、\\ ``MP4`` 或 "
"``CCSD(T)`` 之前放置"

msgid "``PAPT``"
msgstr "``PAPT``"

msgid ""
"in the input before ``MP2``, ``MP3``, ``MP4`` or ``CCSD(T)``. The effect of "
"the ``PAPT`` is to define a new set of orbitals and effective hamiltonian "
"eigenvalues that are used in subsequent correlation treatments."
msgstr ""
"在输入中置于 ``MP2``\\ 、\\ ``MP3``\\ 、\\ ``MP4`` 或 ``CCSD(T)`` 之前。\\ ``PAPT`` "
"的作用是定义一组新的轨道和有效哈密顿量本征值，用于后续的相关性处理。"

msgid "``MP4;NOTRIPL; performs MP4(SDQ) calculations.``"
msgstr "``MP4;NOTRIPL; 执行 MP4(SDQ) 计算。``"

msgid "``EXPEC[,[TYPE=]type][,opname]``"
msgstr "``EXPEC[,[TYPE=]type][,opname]``"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE``:** *type*\\ =\\ ``RELAX``: Compute fully relaxed properties with "
"taking into account the orbital relaxation (default). Nonrelaxed properties "
"are also computed and printed. For MP2, this option is highly recommended."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE``：** *type*\\ =\\ ``RELAX``\\ "
"：在考虑轨道弛豫的情况下计算完全弛豫性质（默认）。非弛豫性质也会被计算并打印。对于 MP2，强烈推荐此选项。"

msgid ""
"*type*\\ =\\ ``NORELAX``: Compute properties without taking into account the"
" orbital relaxation."
msgstr "*type*\\ =\\ ``NORELAX``\\ ：在不考虑轨道弛豫的情况下计算性质。"

msgid "``DM,record.ifil;``"
msgstr "``DM,record.ifil;``"

msgid "``NATORB,[RECORD=]record.ifil,[PRINT=nprint],[CORE[=natcor]];``"
msgstr "``NATORB,[RECORD=]record.ifil,[PRINT=nprint],[CORE[=natcor]];``"

msgid ""
"``CPHF, [THRMIN=thrmin], [THRMAX=thrmax], [MAXIT=maxit], [SHIFT=shift], "
"[SAVE=record], [START=record], [DIIS=idiis], [DISM=idism]``"
msgstr ""
"``CPHF, [THRMIN=thrmin], [THRMAX=thrmax], [MAXIT=maxit], [SHIFT=shift], "
"[SAVE=record], [START=record], [DIIS=idiis], [DISM=idism]``"

msgid ""
"``THRMAX`` initial CPHF convergence threshold in geometry optimizations. "
"Once the geometry is converged to a certain accuracy (depending on "
"``OPTCONV``), the threshold is stepwise reduced to ``THRMIN``."
msgstr ""
"``THRMAX`` 几何优化中 CPHF 的初始收敛阈值。一旦几何收敛到一定精度（取决于 ``OPTCONV``\\ ），该阈值将逐步降低至 "
"``THRMIN``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The default is ``THRMAX``\\ =min(1.d-6,\\ ``THRMIN``\\*100); Values larger "
"than 1.d-6 are ignored."
msgstr "默认值为 ``THRMAX``\\ =min(1.d-6,\\ ``THRMIN``\\*100)；大于 1.d-6 的值将被忽略。"

msgid "``DF-MP2,options``"
msgstr "``DF-MP2,options``"

msgid ""
"**``BASIS_MP2``\\ =\\ *basis*:** Fitting basis set. *basis* can either refer"
" to a basis set defined in a ``BASIS`` block, or to a default fitting basis "
"set (only available for correlation consistent basis sets). If a correlation"
" consistent orbital basis set is used, the corresponding MP2 fitting basis "
"is generated by default. In all other cases, the fitting basis must be "
"defined."
msgstr ""
"**``BASIS_MP2``\\ =\\ *\\ basis\\ *：** 拟合基组。*\\ basis* 可以引用在 ``BASIS`` "
"块中定义的基组，也可以引用默认拟合基组（仅对相关一致基组可用）。如果使用相关一致轨道基组，则默认生成相应的 MP2 "
"拟合基组。在所有其他情况下，必须定义拟合基组。"

msgid ""
"**``THRAO``\\ =\\ *value*:** Screening threshold for 3-index integrals in "
"the AO basis"
msgstr "**``THRAO``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *：** AO 基组中三中心积分的筛选阈值"

msgid ""
"**``THRMO``\\ =\\ *value*:** Screening threshold for 3-index integrals in "
"the MO basis"
msgstr "**``THRMO``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *：** MO 基组中三中心积分的筛选阈值"

msgid ""
"**``THROV``\\ =\\ *value*:** Screening threshold for 2-index integrals of "
"fitting basis."
msgstr "**``THROV``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *：** 拟合基组二中心积分的筛选阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPROD``\\ =\\ *value*:** Screening product threshold for first half "
"transformation."
msgstr "**``THRPROD``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *：** 第一半变换的筛选乘积阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``SPARSE``\\ =\\ *value*:** If Non-zero, use sparse algorithm in second-"
"half transformation (default)."
msgstr "**``SPARSE``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *：** 若非零，则在第二半变换中使用稀疏算法（默认）。"

msgid ""
"See section :doc:`density fitting <density_fitting>` for a more general "
"description of density fitting. Expectation values and gradients can also be"
" computed with ``DF-MP2``."
msgstr ""
"关于密度拟合的更一般描述，请参见章节 :doc:`密度拟合 <density_fitting>`\\ 。期望值和梯度也可以使用 ``DF-MP2`` "
"计算。"

msgid "``MP2, SCSFACS=facs, SCSFACT=fact``"
msgstr "``MP2, SCSFACS=facs, SCSFACT=fact``"

msgid ""
"``DF-MP2,[DF_BASIS=fitbasis],SCSGRD=1,[ SCSFACS=facs], [SCSFACT=fact]``"
msgstr ""
"``DF-MP2,[DF_BASIS=fitbasis],SCSGRD=1,[ SCSFACS=facs], [SCSFACT=fact]``"

msgid ""
"followed by ``FORCES`` or ``OPTG``. In these cases, the SCS-MP2 total energy"
" replaces the MP2 total energy in the variable ``EMP2``. Expectation values "
"can also be computed with ``DF-SCS-MP2``, where the SCS-MP2 density matrix "
"is used instead of the MP2 density matrix (see section `expectation values "
"for MP2 <moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#expectation-values-for-"
"mp2>`__). For DF-LMP2 see section :doc:`PAO-based local correlation "
"treatments <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>`."
msgstr ""
"后接 ``FORCES`` 或 ``OPTG``\\ 。在这些情况下，SCS-MP2 总能量将替换变量 ``EMP2`` 中的 MP2 "
"总能量。期望值也可以使用 ``DF-SCS-MP2`` 计算，此时使用 SCS-MP2 密度矩阵代替 MP2 密度矩阵（参见章节 `MP2 的期望值 "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#expectation-values-for-mp2>`__\\ "
"）。关于 DF-LMP2，请参见章节 :doc:`基于 PAO 的局域相关处理 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments>`\\ 。"
